        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "iring functions cannot be proven consistent. Parallel arcs are distinct derivations. Equal totals preserve deterministic state/arc traversal order. The current trace-copying implementation favors auditability over large-graph efficiency: it retains up to `k` explicit prefixes per state, each carrying its full state and arc trace.\r",
